# Object.defineProperties(target, Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptors(source)) behind a check that may fail. The copy comes back behind a call that may run unknown code, and the first of the two calls is one.
# SimplifyBuiltinCalls makes two halves of one operation of the two, each where its call stood, where it finds the first in the block of the second: a way back between them would leave a block parameter in its place, in the typed code too.
# So the copy holds both calls and comes back behind the second. Where the descriptors go elsewhere as well nothing is made of the two, and the copy comes back behind the first
# FORM: Prepared
# OPTIONS: heat=NothingIsHottest
# RUN: pass AddGenericVersion
# RUN(DEFINITIONS): pass AddGenericVersion
# RUN(FUSED): function-passes AddGenericVersion ResolveBuiltins SimplifyBuiltinCalls
# CHECK: outcome: Changed

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js" flags=[IsLibrary]
variable g0 name="kept" module=m0 declared={type=anything} initialization=Undefined

function f0 name="bothCallsAreCopied" parameters=[{type=anything}, {type=object}, {type=object}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: anything, v1: object, v2: object):
    v3 = Check v0 castType=number
    v4 = Add v3, v3
    PutModuleVariable v4 variable=g0
    v6 = Builtin builtin=Object
    v7 = Builtin builtin=ObjectDefineProperties
    v8 = Builtin builtin=ObjectGetOwnPropertyDescriptors
    v9 = Call v8, v6, v2
    v10 = Upcast v9 castType=anything
    v11 = Call v7, v6, v1, v10
    Return v11
}
# CHECK-LABEL: function f0 name="bothCallsAreCopied"
# CHECK-COUNT-2: = Call {{*}}, {{*}}, v2
# DEFINITIONS-LABEL: function f0 name="bothCallsAreCopied"
# DEFINITIONS-COUNT-2: = Call {{*}}, {{*}}, v1,
# FUSED-LABEL: function f0 name="bothCallsAreCopied"
# FUSED-NOT: ObjectGetOwnPropertyDescriptors/0
# FUSED: [[typed]]: object = CallBuiltin -, v2 overload=CompilerHelpersDescribeUnlessOrdinary/
# FUSED: = CallBuiltin -, v1, [[typed]], [[typed]] overload=CompilerHelpersDefinePropertiesFrom/
# FUSED: [[copied]]: object = CallBuiltin -, v2 overload=CompilerHelpersDescribeUnlessOrdinary/
# FUSED: = CallBuiltin -, v1, [[copied]], [[copied]] overload=CompilerHelpersDefinePropertiesFrom/

function f1 name="descriptorsThatAreKeptToo" parameters=[{type=anything}, {type=object}, {type=object}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: anything, v1: object, v2: object):
    v3 = Check v0 castType=number
    v4 = Add v3, v3
    PutModuleVariable v4 variable=g0
    v6 = Builtin builtin=Object
    v7 = Builtin builtin=ObjectDefineProperties
    v8 = Builtin builtin=ObjectGetOwnPropertyDescriptors
    v9 = Call v8, v6, v2
    PutModuleVariable v9 variable=g0
    v11 = Call v7, v6, v1, v9
    Return v11
}
# CHECK-LABEL: function f1 name="descriptorsThatAreKeptToo"
# CHECK-COUNT-2: = Call {{*}}, {{*}}, v2
